{
  "Combat.Hel.BrigidDefeat": "Brigid's poker and shield batter you into submission."
  "Combat.Hel.BrigidVictory": "Brigid collapses, her keyring clattering to the stone floor."
  "Combat.Hel.CumWitchDefeat": "The Cum Witch's magic overwhelms you."
  "Combat.Hel.CumWitchVictory": "The Cum Witch collapses into a puddle of her own spunk."
  "Combat.Hel.EarthshieldDeflect": "Your strike is deflected by the wall of sand, dirt, and rock! Damn!"
  "Combat.Hel.HarpyMobDefeat": "The harpy horde overwhelms you."
  "Combat.Hel.HarpyMobVictory": "The surviving harpies flee up the stairwell. Kiri, the one who held back, lowers her claws."
  "Combat.Hel.HarpyQueenDefeat": "The Harpy Queen's magic and the brood's claws overwhelm you."
  "Combat.Hel.HarpyQueenVictory": "The Harpy Queen collapses. Hel finishes off the last of the brood and turns to you with a grin."
  "Combat.Hel.ImpAfter": "\n[say: Didn't even know it could do all that, really.]\nThe statue cracks into several pieces after its attack."
  "Combat.Hel.ImpBlind": " You're <b>Blinded</b>!"
  "Combat.Hel.ImpDebilitate": "Fully reformed, the imp statue jumps and skips while weaving some type of spell.\n[say: The small one amuses me. Always moving so merrily. Always casting such powerful magic.] The imp statue throws both hands in your direction, casting an invisible spell on you!"
  "Combat.Hel.ImpDebilitateHit": "\nYou're hit in full by the debilitating spell!"
  "Combat.Hel.ImpHex": " You're <b>Hexed</b>!"
  "Combat.Hel.ImpInert": "Without its master control, the imp statue falls apart, inert."
  "Combat.Hel.ImpRebuild": "Pieces of the imp statue move together, the golem slowly reforming itself."
  "Combat.Hel.ImpStun": " You're <b>Stunned</b>!"
  "Combat.Hel.IncubusAfter": "\n[say: Good for more than sex, these demons!]\nThe statue cracks into several pieces after its attack."
  "Combat.Hel.IncubusInert": "Without its master control, the Incubus Statue falls apart, inert."
  "Combat.Hel.IncubusOmnislash": "Fully reformed, the tall incubus brandishes two scimitars. It positions itself in a combat stance, the marble and rock rumbling loudly.\n[say: This is always fun, yes.] The incubus dashes at you with incredible speed and strength!"
  "Combat.Hel.IncubusRebuild": "Pieces of the Incubus Statue move together, the golem slowly reforming itself."
  "Combat.Hel.JeremiahArmorRestored": "<b>\nJeremiah's armor restored!</b>"
  "Combat.Hel.JeremiahRebuild1": "[say: How rude. First, the demons destroyed our chastity. Now, our manners.]"
  "Combat.Hel.JeremiahRebuild2": "[say: Vilkus will be done soon. You can tell him to punish you then. He will be <b>very</b> thorough.]"
  "Combat.Hel.JeremiahRebuild3": "[say: Ah, pain. It is a good way to remember your humanity! You are hurting me, right?]"
  "Combat.Hel.JeremiahRebuild4": "[say: Have I shown you my statues? I really like them. It's like living forever! Or dying forever. Common mistake.]"
  "Combat.Hel.JeremiahRebuildDemon": "[say: Are you a demon? Vilkus said we'd eradicate them all. Ah! You are here to <b>be</b> eradicated! Makes sense.]"
  "Combat.Hel.JeremiahRebuildText": "\nJeremiah glows and pulses with magical energy while smirking, causing the marble fragments in the room to hasten their reforming."
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusAbsorbHurt": "\nLaurentius is hurt from absorbing a defeated creature. (-{0})"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusApotheosis12": "[say: Show me your power, wizard! Unleash your true potential! Conquer reality, overpower it!]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusApotheosis20": "[say: Do you see? The power that your will exerts over the material plane. It is your duty to reshape it, remake it to your will!]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusApotheosis4": "[say: Yes, you are strong! In my travels, I have witnessed many like you. Diamonds in the rough, ready to be refined, to accept the light of Divinity. Embrace it!]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusApotheosisDefault": "[say: Yes! This energy, this flame! These are the building blocks of a new world! This is what the wheel of Time and Space turns upon!]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusApotheosisPulse": "\nThe ethereal entity glows brightly, releasing a pulse of arcane energy!\nThe spell hits you, and instead of being damaged or hurt, you feel enlightened; more connected to the Aether, mind expanding with magical knowledge!\n<b>Doubled Spell Power!</b>\n<b>Laurentius's spell power doubled!</b>"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusFear": "[say: There is nothing in this world that frightens me, [name]. Strengthen your mind, do not attempt to weaken mine.]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusHealed": " <b>(+{0})</b>"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusReality": "\n[say: How trifling. Persuading Reality that I am weaker than you... you will need a stronger argument.]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusShield": "<b>Laurentius steps back and watches, surrounding himself in an impenetrable shield.</b>"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusSummon": "\nThe ethereal sorcerer weaves a powerful spell, creating a glowing cyan ball in his hands. He throws it downwards, and it explodes in a mighty flash!\nThe ball expands, and from it three new enemies appear!\n[say: Behold, Champion. Our souls are a forge, and through it we can reshape worlds. Test the limits of your newfound might, exert your will over lesser beings.]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusSummonAppears": "A new <b>{0}</b> has appeared!"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusUnsummon": "Laurentius steps forward once again. With a wave of his hand, all the summoned enemies vanish, turning into glowing blue dust and flowing towards the wizard. He returns to the fight!\n<b>Laurentius is no longer invincible!</b>"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusWatches": "Laurentius watches."
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusWhitefire1": "[say: The flesh is a trap. No paths lead hence.]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusWhitefire2": "[say: This world burns. We can build one that endures.]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusWhitefire3": "[say: They sought to return to their world. I sought to make a new, better one.]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusWhitefire4": "[say: Survive. Show me that the fire that burns inside you is stronger than the one around you.]"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusWhitefireBurst": "\nThe ethereal being waves a hand in the air. The ground under your feet wobbles, and, suddenly, a massive pillar of blue fire and lightning bursts forth!"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusWhitefireDodged": "\nYou manage to jump out of the way in time!"
  "Combat.Hel.LaurentiusWhitefireHit": "\nYou fail to dodge in time, and are scorched by the all-burning magical flames!"
  "Combat.Hel.PhoenixGrenadierLeaderless": "Without her leader's orders, the Phoenix Grenadier doesn't know what to do!"
  "Combat.Hel.PhoenixPyroLeaderless": "Without her leader's orders, the Phoenix Pyro doesn't know what to do!"
  "Combat.Hel.PhoenixSapperLeaderless": "Without her leader's orders, the Phoenix Sapper doesn't know what to do!"
  "Combat.Hel.SandMotherDefeat": "The Sand Mother's magic overwhelms you."
  "Combat.Hel.SandMotherVictory": "The Sand Mother falls, and the coven's resistance collapses."
  "Combat.Hel.SandWitchMobDefeat": "The mob of sand witches drags you down."
  "Combat.Hel.SandWitchMobVictory": "The sand witches scatter, their barrier collapsing."
  "Combat.Hel.SentinelDefeat": "The sentinels overwhelm you."
  "Combat.Hel.SentinelFalls": "The living statue shatters!"
  "Combat.Hel.StatueHealed": "\n{0} is healed! <b>(+{1})</b>"
  "Combat.Hel.StatueLustBreak": "The statue stops and begins vibrating. In an instant, it cracks, unable to contain its own lust."
  "Combat.Hel.StatueShield": "You're hit by the spell, but thankfully manage to raise your shield in time. The black magic is absorbed and nullified!"
  "Combat.Hel.SuccubusAfter": "\n[say: Oh, just give up and pleasure yourself. We're all human, it's fine to do it every once in a while! Well, I'm not. Am I?]\nThe statue cracks into several pieces after its attack."
  "Combat.Hel.SuccubusInert": "Without its master control, the Succubus Statue falls apart, inert."
  "Combat.Hel.SuccubusLustpocalypse": "Fully reformed, the Succubus Statue teases and flaunts her own body, the flawless craftsmanship of the piece creating a perfect illusion of a real, flesh and blood seductress. Your heart skips a beat as she palms her perfect breasts and nipples, her wide hips and perfect pussy...\n[say: Marvelous, and so very sinful! Forbidden! FORBIDDEN!] The statue's hands glow with black magic, and, detecting your lack of focus, she launches a spell at you!"
  "Combat.Hel.SuccubusLustpocalypseHit": "\nYou're hit in full by the arousing spell, and you lose your breath over the sudden lust infusion you've received. Gods, you need to fuck something right now!"
  "Combat.Hel.SuccubusRebuild": "Pieces of the Succubus Statue move together, the golem slowly reforming itself."
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusArouse": "[say: Your resolve is weak. Desire, bubbling through the surface. Let it spew forth, so it may be purged.] Your opponent raises an arm, and with an arcane chant, releases a wave of black magic against you!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusArouseHit": "You're hit by the spell, and immediately feel warmer."
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusArouseNoMemories": " The effect is short lived, however, and you feel no worse for wear!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusBlind": "[say: Darkness comprehends not the light, merciful Marae. Reveal unto them their own wickedness, ignorance torn by your holy presence, and let them be lost in your radiance.]\nThe Inquisitor holds his sword aloft, and a bright magical light shines forth from it!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusBlindAvoided": "\nYou manage to blink in time, avoiding the blinding attack."
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusBlinded": " <b>You are blinded!</b>"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusChargeWeapon": "The Inquisitor raises his sword with both hands and stares devoutly at it. [say: As I carry thine word and bless thine radiance, please let me carry thine strength and purge thine enemies.]\nHe lifts one hand and softly slides it over the blade, and the sword begins glowing and crackling with magical energy.\nLooks like he'll deal more damage with melee attacks now!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusDodged": "You manage to jump out of the way just in time, avoiding the magical attack."
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusEnergyWave": "Vilkus holds his sword aloft. The blade pulses with power and he slashes the air, sending a wave of energy at you!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusEnergyWaveHit": "You're hit by the energy wave, and it cuts straight through your armor. You wince in pain as the corruptive force burns you from the inside!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusFear": "[say: I shall never tremble or fear, for I stand with Marae, and those who stand with Her are blessed for eternity!]"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusFirstPhase": "The Inquisitor stumbles back and falls to the ground, wounded and bleeding.\\\n\\\n[say: Marae... why hast thou challenged me so? No word of mine is spoken without thy blessing, my hand only knows thine guidance, so why... why did we fall?]\\\n\\\nThe Inquisitor wheezes in pain. [say: Marae... my love for thee is eternal. I will serve thee even if my soul left me, my breath left my lungs.]\\\n\\\nHe looks at his hands, stained with blood, both old and fresh, mementos of a thousand flagellations. [say: I see... I can still serve thee. If I cannot burn all corruption, then I will take it upon myself, and my spirit will scorch it to cinders.]\\\n\\\nThe Inquisitor rises and kneels, holding his sword with both hands. It begins glowing brightly, illuminating the entire chamber. He rises, and the lethicite crystals around the room glow. Trails of energy wisp out of the crystals and into the blade.\\\n\\\nAfter a few moments, the crystals lose their glow, turning an opaque gray.\\\n[say: I will burn... Consume everything. In a world without life, there can be no corruption.]\\\n\\\nWith a decisive motion, the Inquisitor stabs himself once again. Purple energy envelops him as he screams and trembles, his voice slowly becoming deeper and more inhumane.\\\n\\\nHe removes the sword from his abdomen, the blood on the blade pitch black, a dark purple aura enveloping the entirety of the weapon. [say: Yes. Even now, I can serve you, Marae.]\\\n\\\nHe points the sword at you. You have another fight on your hands!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusHeal": "[say: You cannot stop me. For as long as corruption remains, I will stand tall, to purge it, raze it to ash.] Your opponent presses the hilt of his sword against his chest and chants some holy passage. Miraculously, his wounds begin to heal!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusHealed": " <b>(+{0})</b>"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusPhaseAttack1": "Vilkus jumps, launching himself in the air with unnatural force, and lunges at you!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusPhaseAttack2": "Vilkus rears back, and thrusts his estoc towards you, dashing forwards with uncanny speed!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusPhaseAttack3": "Vilkus rolls towards you and jumps with a slashing pirouette, displaying unmatched agility!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusReflectBlind": "\n<b>Your spell overpowers the Inquisitor's</b>, and its magical energy is absorbed into yours, for an extremely effective attack!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusSacrifice": "[say: No. I will not fall. I cannot be tempted.]\nYour opponent roars, creating a blast of force that knocks you back for a moment. He then takes his sword and swiftly stabs himself in the abdomen. After the sword has fully pierced it, he twists the blade and quickly pulls it out, in a gruesome display.\n\nHe lifts the blade and stares, trembling, at the dripping blood. [say: The pain... I am still myself. I am still devout. Thank you, Marae.]\nYou're not sure how he survived that, but he seems to have overcome his growing lust!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusSelfDamage": "\nBy using his own essence to cast spells, the Inquisitor damages himself. (-{0})"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusShieldAbsorb": "You're hit by the attack, but thankfully manage to raise your shield in time. The spell is absorbed and nullified!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusWhitefire": "[say: Marae, who endureth forever. Cast thine might on the wicked, who art temporary. Raze it to ashes, so that proof of their weakness endureth forever.]\n\nA ball of fire materializes in the Inquisitor's hands. He throws it against you, and it grows to fearsome size!"
  "Combat.Hel.VilkusWhitefireHit": "You're hit in full by the spell, and are viciously scorched by the magical fire!"
}
